<title>JAPAN: Honda Motor shares set new high.</title>
<headline>Honda Motor shares set new high.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Honda Motor Co Ltd set a record high on Tuesday morning as the yen's weakening against the dollar reinforced a trend of buying shares in major export-oriented companies, traders said.</p>
<p>The automaker's shares climbed to a record 3,920 yen at 0028 GMT, a record high, against the previous high of 3,890 marked on Monday.</p>
<p>Its trade volume was 1.263 million shares, making it the ninth heaviest on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange.</p>
